  "2026-02-16": {
    "date": "2026-02-16",
    "journal": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Was pretty productive today. I moved the interview with CNH to Friday so I can do some research on the company. I have to hit this interview out the ballpark. Gotta keep pushing it. We ARE doing GOOD so far. God is looking kindly on us. We must keep making him proud.</p></body></html>",
    "journal_pages": [
      {
        "name": "Main",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Was pretty productive today. I moved the interview with CNH to Friday so I can do some research on the company. I have to hit this interview out the ballpark. Gotta keep pushing it. We ARE doing GOOD so far. God is looking kindly on us. We must keep making him proud.</p></body></html>",
        "created_at": "",
        "tag": null
      },
      {
        "name": "School",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">I aced the Programming Exam and the Systems Analysis Exam. Kind of dissappointed. The classes are too easy right now. Maybe I'm in my head right now. I love the professors, especially the one for Systems, but I feel like the content is going too slowly and I can be working a lot harder right now. Other than that, I was not very productive when it came to AeroStructures. Almost slept a few times. Finished the homework that was due at 11:30. Kind of a slow day, but we managed to push through.</p></body></html>",
        "created_at": "",
        "tag": "School"
      },
      {
        "name": "Work",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">We hit a goot workout today. Really did not want to go. My energy just dropped right after finishing my classes. I wanted to sleep I won't lie. I went to the gym right after class to hit back and bis. It felt really good I won't life. I then ran ~5.1 miles with Michael in downtown. My achillies really hurt this run. It was slightly rough, but I managed to push through it. I have to look into it more. <br /><br />Did weighted pullups. I only managed to do 10 pull ups today on the first go. Felt like I could've done more, but I didn't want it enough. Otherwise it was a really good day. Must keep pushing.</p></body></html>",
        "created_at": "",
        "tag": "Work"
      },
      {
        "name": "Goose",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Worked with Batu over discord. He is still learning the program, but I is slowly getting there. Gotta do some research and coding. I will work on it more tomorrow. I also have to figure out the camera cable since the current one is unusable as of right now. Have more research to do in general tomorrow.</p></body></html>",
