      {
        "name": "Gym",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">We htia PR today!<br /><br />Bench - 240lbs for 2!!!!<br /><br />Lifted with Caleb. Not sure why, but I felt VERY strong today. <br />Very greatful that the Lord gave me the strength to lift heavy today.<br />Was spamming the 75lbs on the Incline Bench. Otherwise, it was a fun session with Caleb. <br /></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">We hit the bikes for 10mins after the lift. He lives <span style=\" font-weight:700;\">~5 mins</span> from the gym. </p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Should try to lift with him on Tuesdays or Thursdays.</p></body></html>",
        "created_at": "",
        "tag": "Gym"
